{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の夏の画像がフォルダ漁ってたら出てきたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏っぽいね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは夏らしいことしてるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはスイカ沢山食べたり、夏休みの宿題してる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年乃木坂に入ってから夏は全国ツアーができて\nこうして今、全国まわってると\n今年も夏がきた〜ってかんじ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に綺麗なお花をありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪ではたこ焼きをたべ、満員のファンの方が迎えてくれて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋では味噌カツをたべ、ファンの方もメンバーやスタッフさんも大阪に負けないぐらいの盛り上がりで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は仙台と福岡だね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達も全力の笑顔とダンスで盛り上がるので、待っててください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、また美味しいの食べれるのも楽しみ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてラストはバースデーライブの神宮ライブだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に夏の締めくくりって気分"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで気を抜かず頑張っていきます〜‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番奥の席まで笑顔が届きますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前あみちゃんが急に\n「まあやんち行きたいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nって言って泊まりにきたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜3時ぐらいまでお話して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂はいったりして 一緒に寝たよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その次の日がアルバム特典のイベントだったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣以来の乃木神社でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか清められた感じがします(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神社好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくださいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中遠くから来てくださったり\n短い時間でしたがありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午後の黒ひげゲーム？っていうのかな？あのイベントはなんか新鮮で、それもあっという間の時間だったなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのグループは4回もパーフェクト出てサインプレゼント出来きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応募してくださった方！来てくださった方ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても素敵な時間を一緒に過ごせて楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい夏休みの思い出が１つ増えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ中の楽屋とか車移動はいつもひなちまと一緒にいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちかが早く着いたら席とって待ってたりするぐらい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は一緒にご飯食べに行ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまいつもありがとね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥誕生日おめでとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一期生最年少同士！初期の頃から歳も同じなので仲良くて、この前おうちのプリクラ昔のとか見てたら飛鳥との沢山出てきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちが中学の頃のプリクラもあって飛鳥が落書きで我らの友情永遠不滅なり！って書いてて時代感じたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと他の言い方なかったんかいね( › ·̮ ‹ )笑でもなんか面白かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また取ろうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだよ〜！！\n素敵な一年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0024.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇお花ってどうやったら長持ちするのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"置く場所とかで違うのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ枯れちゃうから悲しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもとっても綺麗だよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に前回の8月6日のブログに沢山の言葉をもらいました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も みんなが笑顔でありますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/12/0261867/0020.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}